<section id="covers"><div class="wrap">
  <h2><span class="lang-zh">竖屏视频封面</span><span class="lang-en">Vertical video covers</span></h2>
  <p class="lede"><span class="lang-zh">图里一个字都没有,上面留一大块空白;标题是网页上的字,叠在图上,改字不用重新出图。发到短视频平台时,右边一列和底部会被按钮、文案挡住,标题放在上面这块空白里正好避开(见图例库「短视频画面」)。</span><span class="lang-en">No words in the pictures, and a large empty band at the top. The title is page text laid on top, so changing it needs no new image. On short-video apps the right column and the bottom are covered by buttons and captions; a title in the top band stays clear of both (see "Video frame" in the figures).</span></p>
  <div class="covers">
    <figure class="asset g-box"><div class="cover"><img src="media/cover-code.webp" width="941" height="1672" alt="竖屏封面:小机器人坐在木桌前用笔记本电脑,一边回头挥手,桌上有咖啡杯和便签" data-label-zh="竖屏封面:小机器人坐在木桌前用笔记本电脑,一边回头挥手,桌上有咖啡杯和便签" data-label-en="Vertical cover: the robot at a wooden desk with a laptop, turning to wave; a mug and sticky notes on the desk" loading="lazy">
      <p class="cover-title"><span class="lang-zh">一行代码在做什么</span><span class="lang-en">What one line of code does</span><small><span class="lang-zh">大白话讲代码 · 第 1 集</span><span class="lang-en">Code in plain words · ep. 1</span></small></p></div>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">写代码的小机器人</span><span class="lang-en">The robot at work</span></b><span class="lang-zh">941 × 1672(9:16)· 上面 42% 没有画东西 · <a href="media/cover-code.webp" download>下载原图</a></span><span class="lang-en">941 × 1672 (9:16) · nothing drawn in the top 42% · <a href="media/cover-code.webp" download>download</a></span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="asset g-box"><div class="cover night"><img src="media/cover-board.webp" width="941" height="1672" alt="竖屏封面,深色:夜里小机器人站在凳子上,在黑板上用粉笔画一条抛物线和几个往谷底走的点,旁边一盏台灯" data-label-zh="竖屏封面,深色:夜里小机器人站在凳子上,在黑板上用粉笔画一条抛物线和几个往谷底走的点,旁边一盏台灯" data-label-en="Vertical cover, dark: at night the robot stands on a stool and chalks a curve with dots stepping down to its bottom; a desk lamp beside it" loading="lazy">
      <p class="cover-title"><span class="lang-zh">梯度下降,三分钟</span><span class="lang-en">Gradient descent in three minutes</span><small><span class="lang-zh">数学原理 · 夜读</span><span class="lang-en">Maths, after dark</span></small></p></div>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">黑板前 · 深色</span><span class="lang-en">At the blackboard · dark</span></b><span class="lang-zh">941 × 1672 · 上面 33% 没有画东西 · 台灯是唯一的光 · <a href="media/cover-board.webp" download>下载原图</a></span><span class="lang-en">941 × 1672 · nothing drawn in the top 33% · the lamp is the only light · <a href="media/cover-board.webp" download>download</a></span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="asset g-box"><div class="cover"><img src="media/cover-walk.webp" width="941" height="1672" alt="竖屏封面:日出时,人牵着小机器人的手沿着山间小路往远处走,背影" data-label-zh="竖屏封面:日出时,人牵着小机器人的手沿着山间小路往远处走,背影" data-label-en="Vertical cover: at sunrise the person and the robot walk hand in hand down a country path, seen from behind" loading="lazy">
      <p class="cover-title"><span class="lang-zh">和 AI 一起走一段</span><span class="lang-en">A walk with an AI</span><small><span class="lang-zh">周末随笔</span><span class="lang-en">Weekend notes</span></small></p></div>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">日出散步</span><span class="lang-en">Sunrise walk</span></b><span class="lang-zh">941 × 1672 · 上面 56% 只有天空和淡云 · <a href="media/cover-walk.webp" download>下载原图</a></span><span class="lang-en">941 × 1672 · the top 56% is only sky and faint clouds · <a href="media/cover-walk.webp" download>download</a></span></figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="poses"><div class="wrap">
  <h2><span class="lang-zh">角色姿势表</span><span class="lang-en">Character pose sheets</span></h2>
  <p class="lede"><span class="lang-zh">同一套角色,和首屏插画是同一个机器人、同一个人。背景是纸色(约 #fcf7e5),不是透明的:放在浅色页面上加 <code>mix-blend-mode: multiply</code>,纸色就和页面融在一起;要单个姿势,裁下来用。</span><span class="lang-en">The same cast as the hero picture: same robot, same person. The background is paper (about #fcf7e5), not transparent: on a light page add <code>mix-blend-mode: multiply</code> and the paper melts into the page; crop out any single pose you need.</span></p>
  <div class="assets">
    <figure class="asset g-box"><a href="media/poses-robot.webp" download><img src="media/poses-robot.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="小机器人八个姿势:挥手、托腮想事、坐着用电脑、抱着箱子走、指向右边、跳起来欢呼、闭眼坐着休息、拿放大镜看" data-label-zh="小机器人八个姿势:挥手、托腮想事、坐着用电脑、抱着箱子走、指向右边、跳起来欢呼、闭眼坐着休息、拿放大镜看" data-label-en="The robot in eight poses: waving, thinking, sitting with a laptop, carrying a box, pointing, jumping for joy, resting with eyes closed, looking through a magnifier" loading="lazy"></a>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">小机器人 · 八个姿势</span><span class="lang-en">Robot · eight poses</span></b><span class="lang-zh">1672 × 941 · 挥手、想事、用电脑、搬箱子、指、欢呼、休息、找东西</span><span class="lang-en">1672 × 941 · wave, think, type, carry, point, cheer, rest, search</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="asset g-box"><a href="media/poses-person.webp" download><img src="media/poses-person.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="人物八个姿势:挥手、托腮想事、看书、坐在凳子上用电脑、指向右边、跳起来欢呼、捧着杯子、背着包走路" data-label-zh="人物八个姿势:挥手、托腮想事、看书、坐在凳子上用电脑、指向右边、跳起来欢呼、捧着杯子、背着包走路" data-label-en="The person in eight poses: waving, thinking, reading, on a stool with a laptop, pointing, jumping for joy, holding a mug, walking with a backpack" loading="lazy"></a>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">人物 · 八个姿势</span><span class="lang-en">Person · eight poses</span></b><span class="lang-zh">1672 × 941 · 挥手、想事、看书、用电脑、指、欢呼、喝水、出门</span><span class="lang-en">1672 × 941 · wave, think, read, type, point, cheer, drink, head out</span></figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="asset g-box"><a href="media/poses-duo.webp" download><img src="media/poses-duo.webp" width="1672" height="941" alt="人和小机器人六个互动:击掌、递一张纸、并排坐着看电脑、一起抬箱子、背靠背看书、一起指向远处" data-label-zh="人和小机器人六个互动:击掌、递一张纸、并排坐着看电脑、一起抬箱子、背靠背看书、一起指向远处" data-label-en="The person and the robot in six scenes together: a high five, handing over a sheet, sitting side by side at a laptop, carrying a box together, reading back to back, pointing ahead together" loading="lazy"></a>
      <figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">两个人一起 · 六个互动</span><span class="lang-en">Together · six scenes</span></b><span class="lang-zh">1672 × 941 · 讲「人和 AI 一起做事」时用;这张里人物穿牛仔裤,和上一张的米白裤子不同</span><span class="lang-en">1672 × 941 · for "a person and an AI working together"; here the person wears jeans, unlike the cream trousers on the sheet before</span></figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="svg"><div class="wrap">
  <h2><span class="lang-zh">代码画的 SVG:贴纸、批注、视频画面</span><span class="lang-en">Code-drawn SVG: stickers, marks, video frames</span></h2>
  <p class="lede"><span class="lang-zh">单独的 SVG 文件跟随系统深浅色,打开就会自己画一遍。要 PNG 或 MP4:<code>node skills/graphite-design/scripts/export.mjs png 文件.svg 输出.png --scale=3</code>。</span><span class="lang-en">The standalone SVGs follow the system light/dark setting and draw themselves when opened. For PNG or MP4: <code>node skills/graphite-design/scripts/export.mjs png file.svg out.png --scale=3</code>.</span></p>
  <div class="assets assets--wide">
    <figure class="asset g-box">{{fig:cast-robot}}<figcaption><b><span class="lang-zh">小机器人贴纸</span><span class="lang-en">Robot stickers</span></b><a href="../../skills/graphite-design/templates/figures/cast-robot.svg" download>cast-robot.svg</a></figcaption></figure>
